# | Moxa ioThinx 45MR-6810 — 8-channel Thermocouple input
# | 
# | Source: ioThinx 4510 Series User's Manual V2.1, August 2019, Appendix A
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP via ioThinx 4510 adapter, port 502
# | 
# | IMPORTANT: Addresses are MODULE-RELATIVE. Actual PDU address = slot_base + relative_address.
# | Slot base depends on which slot this module occupies in the ioThinx 4510 chassis.
# | 
# | FC01 (coil R/W): tcResetMinValue ch0-7 (8 BOOL, W=1 to reset min tracking),
# | tcResetMaxValue ch0-7 (8 BOOL, W=1 to reset max tracking)
# | FC03 (holding R/W): see [[registers]] below
# | FC04 (input R): tcValueScaled ch0-7 (f32, 2 regs/ch = 16 regs),
# | tcValueScaledMin ch0-7 (f32, 16 regs), tcValueScaledMax ch0-7 (f32, 16 regs),
# | tcType ch0-7 (8 WORD, 0=J 1=K 2=T 3=E 4=R 5=S 6=B 7=N
